00:03:20,300 --> 00:03:26,500
鍵をかけて 閉じこもっているの
Locking the door, shutting myself away...

3
00:03:26,800 --> 00:03:29,800
いるの
...away...

4
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:36,200
数え出して 痛みの数 7つ
Counting up all seven aches and pains,

5
00:03:36,500 --> 00:03:42,200
眠るまでずっと 黒い鳥が飛んで見えた
Until I fall asleep, a black bird flew by.

6
00:03:42,500 --> 00:03:48,500
小さい猫は去って消えてた
A tiny cat left and vanished.

7
00:03:49,200 --> 00:03:53,200
心が枯れるまま叫ぶ
Screaming as my heart withers away,

8
00:03:53,500 --> 00:04:02,000
その報いを いつか 曖昧なままで 失くしたイメージの中へ
Calling for that retribution, someday vaguely drifting into a lost image.

9
