凪いだ日々がまた 崩れ落ちて行くとしても
Even if my calm days crumble down once again,

12
00:04:18,000 --> 00:04:23,500
――
...

13
00:04:25,500 --> 00:04:30,500
鍵を壊して 誰か繋がっているの
Breaking the lock, is someone connected?

14
00:04:30,800 --> 00:04:35,500
いるの
(Connected...)

15
00:04:35,800 --> 00:04:42,200
数え出して 視界阻み 騙る
Counting up, obscuring vision, deceiving—

16
00:04:42,500 --> 00:04:48,000
偽物打ち壊せ 黒い渦が巻いて見えた
Smash the impostors, a black vortex appeared.

17
00:04:48,500 --> 00:04:54,800
小さい苦しみだけ消えてた
Only the small sufferings vanished.

18
