76
00:12:09,116 --> 00:12:13,536
Let it all out

77
00:12:13,936 --> 00:12:17,896
強がらなくていいんだね
You don't have to act tough, right?

78
00:12:19,476 --> 00:12:24,456
誰かが描いてった
Someone drew...

79
00:12:24,976 --> 00:12:29,816
壁の落書きの花が 揺れる
The graffiti flower on the wall sways.

80
00:12:31,076 --> 00:12:35,816
自分らしさなんて 誰もわからないよ
Nobody knows what being yourself is.

81
00:12:36,616 --> 00:12:41,516
長い長い道の途中で 失くしたり拾ったり
Along the long, long road, losing and finding things,

82
00:12:42,356 --> 00:12:47,356
急に寂しくなって 泣いちゃう日もあるけど
There are days when I suddenly feel lonely and want to cry,

83
00:12:48,316 --> 00:12:53,096
涙も 痛みも 星に変えよう
Let's turn tears and pain into stars,

84
00:12:53,656 --> 00:12:57,976
明日を照らす 灯りをともそう
Let's light the lamp that illuminates tomorrow.

85
00:12:58,956 --> 00:13:05,196
小さく迷っても ふたりで作ろう 星屑を
Even if we get a little lost, let's create stardust together,

86
00:13:11,196 --> 00:13:14,996
強く光る永遠を探そう
Let's search for eternity that shines strongly.

87
00:13:25,056 --> 00:13:29,576
Let it all out Let it all out

88
00:13:30,236 --> 00:13:35,096
足りないことだらけだよね
It's full of things we lack, isn't it?

89
00:13:36,156 --> 00:13:41,036
足りなくていいんだね
It's okay to lack them,

90
00:13:41,416 --> 00:13:46,076
だから君と出会えたんだ
That's why I was able to meet you.

91
00:13:47,176 --> 00:13:52,136
｢確か｣ が何なのか それが知りたくて
Wanting to know what certainty really is,

92
00:13:52,556 --> 00:14:00,616
小さなナイフを靴下に隠してた
I hid a small knife in my sock.

93
00:14:01,036 --> 00:14:06,336
強がってついた 嘘の方がずっと痛かった
The lies I told while acting tough hurt much more.

94
00:14:11,096 --> 00:14:16,496
本当は 恐いよ だけど生きてく
Actually, I'm scared, but I'll keep living,

95
00:14:16,856 --> 00:14:20,496
笑顔の君を風が撫でてく
The wind caresses you as you smile.

96
00:14:20,796 --> 00:14:24,976
小さな手かざして ふたりで作ろう 星屑を
Holding up a small hand, let's create stardust together,

97
00:14:30,836 --> 00:14:41,096
正しいことが間違ってたら どうすればいい? 悲しいことが正しかったら 受け入れるだけ?
What should we do if right was wrong? If sadness was right, do we just accept it?

98
00:14:41,876 --> 00:14:50,056
失くしたと思ってた でも君が知ってた 君がいて 本当によかった
I thought I had lost it, but you knew. I'm so glad you were here.

99
00:14:51,496 --> 00:14:56,536
Let it all out Let it all out

100
00:14:57,256 --> 00:15:01,036
足りないことだらけだよ
It's full of things we lack...

101
00:16:29,190 --> 00:16:36,070
貴方は風のように 目を閉じては夕暮れ
You are like the wind, closing your eyes as twilight falls,

102
00:16:37,190 --> 00:16:42,870
何を思っているんだろうか
What is it that you are thinking about?

103
00:16:48,130 --> 00:16:55,370
目蓋を開いていた 貴方の目はビイドロ
When you opened your eyelids, your eyes were like glass beads,

104
00:16:56,510 --> 00:17:01,690
少しだけ晴るの匂いがした
And they carried just a hint of the scent of clear skies.

105
00:17:09,130 --> 00:17:17,610
晴れに晴れ、花よ咲け 咲いて晴るのせい
Clear and clearer, flowers bloom, blooming because of the clear skies,

106
00:17:18,870 --> 00:17:24,490
降り止めば雨でさえ 貴方を飾る晴る
Even the rain, when it stops, is the clearing sky that adorns you,

107
00:17:24,850 --> 00:17:27,330
胸を打つ音よ凪げ
Calm, the sound that strikes my heart.

108
00:17:29,090 --> 00:17:36,270
あの雲も越えてゆく 遠くまだ遠くまで
Cross over those clouds as well, far, far into the distance,

109
00:17:53,390 --> 00:18:01,390
貴方は晴れ模様に 目を閉じては青色
You close your eyes to the sunny weather in a shade of blue,

110
00:18:02,350 --> 00:18:07,490
何が悲しいのだろうか
What is it that makes you sad?

111
00:18:12,650 --> 00:18:20,490
目蓋を開いている 貴方の目にビイドロ
When you open your eyelids, in your glass-bead eyes,

112
00:18:21,130 --> 00:18:26,150
