There was a faint hint of the scent of rain.

113
00:18:34,030 --> 00:18:41,590
泣きに泣け、空よ泣け 泣いて雨のせい
Weep and weep, O sky, weep and blame it on the rain,

114
00:18:43,110 --> 00:18:48,610
降り頻る雨でさえ 雲の上では晴る
Even the falling rain is a clearing sky above the clouds,

115
00:18:52,470 --> 00:19:00,610
土を打つ音よ鳴れ 僕ら春荒れ
Resound, the sound beating against the earth, we are a spring storm,

116
00:19:01,970 --> 00:19:10,450
あの海も越えてゆく 遠くまだ遠くまで
Crossing over that sea as well, far, far into the distance,

117
00:19:27,310 --> 00:19:34,550
通り雨 草を靡かせ 羊雲 あれも春のせい
A passing shower makes the grass sway, mackerel clouds—those too are spring's doing,

118
00:19:37,150 --> 00:19:46,310
