Carrying spring in our hearts like the wind, waiting for the clearing skies,

119
00:19:51,190 --> 00:19:59,210
晴れに晴れ、空よ裂け 裂いて春のせい
Clear and clearer, sky, tear apart, tearing apart because of the clear skies,

120
00:20:02,356 --> 00:20:09,206
晴れに晴れ、花よ咲け
Clear, so clear, let the flowers bloom...

121
00:20:10,236 --> 00:20:18,976
咲いて晴るのせい
Blooming because of the clear skies...

122
00:20:20,086 --> 00:20:28,206
